Scoped dilation video filter

The option table, pixel-format list, plane geometry, border tables and dilation
kernel in src/video-ops/dilation.ts follow libavfilter/vf_neighbor.c (options,
pix_fmts, dilation, config_input, filter_slice with coordinates, coordinateslb,
coordinatesrb and the nh/ph row clamps, filter_frame).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
